WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents
doramamania

00:00:25.560 --> 01:13:29.300
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:47.660
This is some kind of madness!

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:51.040
Is killing and reviving a person such entertainment?

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.000
We can't interfere

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:55.790
because Moo Deok foolishly agreed

00:00:57.090 --> 00:00:58.300
This girl

00:01:00.760 --> 00:01:02.050
smiled

00:01:02.130 --> 00:01:04.680
Okay. I agree

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.390
She agreed

00:01:11.480 --> 00:01:14.310
because of the gold he will receive

00:01:14.900 --> 00:01:17.110
Is it really because of the gold?

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.610
was she smiling?

00:01:33.710 --> 00:01:35.960
I don't like it either

00:01:37.040 --> 00:01:39.300
So I'll kill you painlessly

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:41.800
This is not to show my death

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:45.050
We do this to show how I will be resurrected

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:51.640
They are using the book to buy time to expose you.

00:01:52.220 --> 00:01:54.730
When she dies, they will call on the power of the stone,

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:58.440
use this time to move into her body

00:01:58.520 --> 00:02:02.190
The council ends when the queen dies

00:02:03.110 --> 00:02:07.030
And we will calmly leave Sosnovy Bor with a stone

00:02:09.780 --> 00:02:13.370
I wonder why His Majesty chose her out of everyone?

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:16.250
She's the weakest among us

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:17.960
He made the right choice

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo, Zero Amamiya

00:03:26.110 --> 00:03:27.320
My beauty

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:30.360
My Boo Young

00:03:39.210 --> 00:03:40.330
Mother

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.870
Nobody is looking at you

00:04:12.950 --> 00:04:14.700
Move your soul

00:04:15.530 --> 00:04:17.080
It's not me

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:20.000
I don't control the stone

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:21.750
Then who?

00:05:08.340 --> 00:05:09.630
Stop it

00:05:21.390 --> 00:05:23.810
Mother, are you okay?

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.110
Boo Young...

00:05:33.150 --> 00:05:35.700
Did she recognize her? This is bad

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:38.200
She'll come to life now

00:05:38.780 --> 00:05:40.120
We can't let this happen

00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.540
She must die

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:28.330
What's going on?

00:06:28.830 --> 00:06:30.590
Where is the stone?

00:06:34.460 --> 00:06:35.590
What happened?

00:06:48.310 --> 00:06:49.560
Have you seen it?

00:06:49.650 --> 00:06:52.820
The powers of stone and heaven united

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:55.990
Apparently heaven took the stone

00:06:57.070 --> 00:06:58.610
The stone was not taken

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.450
He's still

00:07:05.410 --> 00:07:06.500
somewhere here

00:07:06.580 --> 00:07:10.500
Where exactly is he?

00:07:36.030 --> 00:07:40.240
Thunder, lightning, and now fog in the middle of the day?

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.950
That's not all

00:07:42.030 --> 00:07:43.410
Something went wrong

00:07:50.710 --> 00:07:53.340
- Did they cover the stone with this?
- Yes

00:07:53.420 --> 00:07:54.590
Did something happen to the stone?

00:07:56.000 --> 00:07:57.460
Is this a dream or what?

00:07:57.550 --> 00:08:00.630
- Flowers everywhere
- Everything is somehow unreal

00:08:01.340 --> 00:08:03.350
Are we dead?

00:08:03.970 --> 00:08:06.430
- Is this the afterlife?
- Hey!

00:08:06.520 --> 00:08:08.140
Stop talking nonsense

00:08:08.230 --> 00:08:11.060
Then I'm the jade emperor and he's a fairy?

00:08:12.940 --> 00:08:14.360
Fairy!

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.620
What is this?

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:27.950
Definitely not a fairy

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:30.000
Ghost?

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:41.680
Are you magicians?

00:08:42.380 --> 00:08:44.640
Yes, the magicians of Jeonjingak

00:08:48.640 --> 00:08:50.020
You are here too, Ms. Ho

00:08:54.310 --> 00:08:55.560
Let me go

00:08:58.530 --> 00:09:01.780
Chan Wook, don't go anywhere, guard this place

00:09:02.490 --> 00:09:03.820
You three

00:09:04.610 --> 00:09:05.620
Explore the area

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:09.370
- I'm going to the study hall
- We will accompany you

00:09:12.120 --> 00:09:13.870
What's going on?

00:09:13.960 --> 00:09:15.210
I heard thunder

00:09:15.290 --> 00:09:17.420
We don't know either

00:09:18.210 --> 00:09:21.210
We'll find out when the fog clears

00:09:21.880 --> 00:09:23.630
If this is not a dream and not the afterlife,

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:26.090
where do all these flowers come from?

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:28.760
Is the fog real?

00:10:04.720 --> 00:10:06.180
What are you doing?

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:07.180
You didn’t understand it yourself

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:10.720
We tried to go out the gate, but a gust of wind threw us back

00:10:10.810 --> 00:10:11.930
Wind?

00:10:13.310 --> 00:10:14.560
There's no wind

00:10:18.230 --> 00:10:20.480
Don't come any closer. We don't see

00:10:20.570 --> 00:10:22.440
but we are surrounded by incredible energy

00:10:22.530 --> 00:10:24.780
What's going on here?

00:10:24.860 --> 00:10:25.820
This is a barrier

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:29.950
I think there's a barrier surrounding Jeonjingak

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:32.040
Barrier?

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.620
Who built it here?

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:34.870
Your Highness

00:10:37.080 --> 00:10:38.330
Your Highness

00:10:38.420 --> 00:10:40.710
Jinyaewon's heiress is here

00:10:41.460 --> 00:10:43.800
Jin Bu Young who brought the ice stone

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:45.550
lay in a faint

00:10:56.890 --> 00:10:57.770
Moo Deok

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:17.790
The energy of the stone penetrated into Jeongjingak

00:11:17.870 --> 00:11:19.880
and created a barrier

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:23.750
Who's inside now?

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:26.590
Chan Wook and Seo Yul are nowhere to be found

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:27.970
They're there most likely

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.510
Ms. Huo is there too

00:11:30.590 --> 00:11:33.100
- My Young Ok!
- Crown Prince

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:34.720
His Highness is there too

00:11:35.470 --> 00:11:38.940
- What?
- Is Bom there too?

00:11:39.020 --> 00:11:41.150
Where is Jin Ho?

00:11:42.110 --> 00:11:43.110
Head Jin,

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:44.400
do something

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:47.690
The stone swallowed your daughter too, she’s probably there too

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.320
There's no hurry

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:53.780
We saw what happened after Jin Bu Young intervened

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:57.830
It's Jinyeowon's fault

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.830
Did you want to see the power of the ice stone?

00:12:01.920 --> 00:12:03.710
Now you want to blame us?

00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.300
Are you about to quarrel again?

00:12:07.380 --> 00:12:10.050
Enough already. The kids are there

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.720
Young Ok!

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.150
You can do something

00:12:31.240 --> 00:12:33.990
with a barrier around Jeonjingak?

00:12:34.070 --> 00:12:35.870
What happened in the study hall?

00:12:37.160 --> 00:12:38.200
This...

00:12:47.960 --> 00:12:50.300
This is definitely because of Moo Deok

00:12:50.380 --> 00:12:53.760
Still, she is the real Jin Bu Young from Jinyoung

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.260
And everyone thinks it's me

00:12:56.350 --> 00:12:58.600
I can't say it's her

00:12:58.680 --> 00:12:59.560
What should I do?

00:13:00.520 --> 00:13:01.850
Answer

00:13:01.940 --> 00:13:03.190
I...

00:13:04.690 --> 00:13:05.980
I don't know

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:09.320
I'm blind so I didn't see what happened

00:13:09.400 --> 00:13:12.150
I lost consciousness when the wind rose and just woke up

00:13:12.240 --> 00:13:14.160
You don't know how you ended up here?

00:13:14.240 --> 00:13:16.700
I don't even know where I am

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:19.580
How do I know how I got here?

00:13:24.000 --> 00:13:26.210
She doesn't look very good

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.920
All pale, sweat on my forehead

00:13:30.010 --> 00:13:31.590
What do you say?

00:13:33.380 --> 00:13:36.220
She needs to rest first, Your Highness

00:13:39.680 --> 00:13:40.680
Let him rest

00:13:42.020 --> 00:13:43.020
Let's go

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:49.940
It's all a lie

00:13:51.400 --> 00:13:52.690
What is she hiding?

00:13:52.780 --> 00:13:54.150
Maybe Moo Deok knows

00:13:54.900 --> 00:13:56.570
Moo Deok, were you with her?

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:00.870
Moo Deok, how did you get here?

00:14:02.120 --> 00:14:04.790
I've been here all the time

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:09.000
Have you been here?

00:14:10.050 --> 00:14:12.510
Didn't you spill the tea in the practice hall?

00:14:13.470 --> 00:14:16.890
Yes, but then I immediately followed you

00:14:16.970 --> 00:14:19.970
I don't know what happened then

00:14:20.930 --> 00:14:23.850
What can you ask a maid who only knows how to

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:28.230
run after your owner like a little dog?

00:14:28.310 --> 00:14:29.860
Don't worry

00:14:30.360 --> 00:14:32.820
Behind the barrier are the best magicians of the Unified Council

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:35.280
They'll get us out quickly

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:38.280
Bring His Highness tea

00:14:38.370 --> 00:14:39.450
Yes

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:55.340
A dog that runs after its owner

00:14:55.420 --> 00:14:57.380
A maid who knows nothing

00:14:58.930 --> 00:15:00.640
This is Moo Deok

00:15:06.940 --> 00:15:08.310
That's right

00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.110
And there is no water

00:16:09.790 --> 00:16:12.750
Tea boiled by a spell tastes best

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.800
A lot of time has passed

00:16:18.510 --> 00:16:22.970
I finally got my strength back thanks to the stone

00:16:32.060 --> 00:16:34.810
What's going on? Where am I?

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:38.860
This time we won't lose

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:41.700
We're in the ice stone

00:16:43.320 --> 00:16:45.200
Is this a stone?

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:48.950
Ice stone is not limited by size or shape

00:16:49.580 --> 00:16:51.790
It could be water, fire

00:16:51.870 --> 00:16:53.540
or the wind

00:16:57.670 --> 00:17:00.010
So the stone is mine now?

00:17:06.970 --> 00:17:09.600
No one can possess the stone

00:17:10.980 --> 00:17:13.060
You can only use its power

00:17:13.140 --> 00:17:15.770
It's like give and take

00:17:15.860 --> 00:17:17.900
You'll gain some, you'll lose some

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:20.940
It's a burden you have to bear.

00:17:21.030 --> 00:17:23.530
I will accept it gladly

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.200
Well, try it

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:27.330
Excessive energy will lead to

00:17:27.950 --> 00:17:30.660
that you can't control the force you use

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:34.000
If you want rain, you will get a flood

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:37.540
If you want wind, you will get a typhoon

00:17:38.500 --> 00:17:39.590
Try to cope

00:17:40.090 --> 00:17:41.300
What are you?

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:43.510
Jinyoewon's relic?

00:17:44.430 --> 00:17:46.840
How dare the soul that lives in my body,

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:49.220
call me a relic?

00:18:17.960 --> 00:18:19.170
Jeongjingak?

00:18:25.470 --> 00:18:26.880
What was that?

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:31.260
Jinyowon's relic attached to the stone?

00:18:37.560 --> 00:18:39.810
Moo Deok, what is this?

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:42.570
Did you bring the prince a broken cup?

00:18:42.650 --> 00:18:44.360
Sorry

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:45.530
I'll change

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:49.410
Stop. I don't need to serve anymore

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:50.950
- Moo Deok
- Yes

00:18:51.530 --> 00:18:53.950
A hundred dirty. Wipe it down

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.160
No need to obey

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.330
Have I become Moo Deok to the core?

00:19:04.130 --> 00:19:05.760
I'm no longer Moo Deok

00:19:05.840 --> 00:19:06.760
Moo Deok

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:14.930
We haven't eaten anything since the council began

00:19:15.020 --> 00:19:16.430
Anything to eat?

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.730
Suzhebi would be suitable for us*

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:19.730
*traditional Korean soup with pieces of dough

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:20.730
Will you do it?

00:19:27.490 --> 00:19:29.950
I Moo Deok until I finish cooking

00:19:30.660 --> 00:19:34.290
And then I will stop being her

00:19:35.370 --> 00:19:37.710
When will I be able to resettle my soul again?

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:40.170
I'll choose any body

00:19:42.420 --> 00:19:43.960
I can even be a king

00:19:51.640 --> 00:19:53.180
Or is it better to kill the enemy

00:19:53.260 --> 00:19:55.600
and take his body for yourself?

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:05.980
I don't want to

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.450
It's better to become Park Jin

00:20:19.460 --> 00:20:21.370
You can choose anyone

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.500
We need to think

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:26.710
Perfect

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.090
It’s a pity to let him go to Suzhebi*

00:20:26.800 --> 00:20:29.090
*soup dough is torn by hand

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.760
Maybe I should make some kuksa?*

00:20:29.170 --> 00:20:30.760
*cold noodle soup

00:20:30.840 --> 00:20:32.800
Chan Wook loves kuksu

00:20:38.560 --> 00:20:40.640
The smell is so weak

00:20:47.400 --> 00:20:51.320
This is the last meal Moo Deok cooks for his master.

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:02.870
- Owner
- Yes?

00:21:04.250 --> 00:21:07.040
I made kuksu, eat it

00:21:07.130 --> 00:21:08.340
Okay

00:21:12.050 --> 00:21:15.430
Now your maid is leaving you

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:18.510
And one more thing...

00:21:20.390 --> 00:21:22.560
here I will stop being your teacher

00:21:24.270 --> 00:21:25.310
Will you stop?

00:21:27.020 --> 00:21:29.070
You probably didn't understand

00:21:29.820 --> 00:21:31.440
we are inside the ice stone

00:21:32.150 --> 00:21:34.320
I regained the strength like at Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:21:36.950 --> 00:21:38.790
And I use this stone for alchemy,

00:21:39.740 --> 00:21:41.370
to leave this body

00:21:43.370 --> 00:21:44.670
That is...

00:21:45.710 --> 00:21:47.380
will we not see each other again?

00:21:47.460 --> 00:21:49.340
We pledged to finish everything

00:21:49.920 --> 00:21:51.880
when will I get my power back

00:21:51.960 --> 00:21:54.840
And then we committed to discussing our future

00:22:01.850 --> 00:22:03.350
Not for us

00:22:05.520 --> 00:22:06.770
a different future

00:22:15.820 --> 00:22:17.870
You'll gain some, you'll lose some

00:22:17.950 --> 00:22:20.830
It's a burden you have to bear.

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:24.410
If I have to lose you in exchange for strength,

00:22:26.000 --> 00:22:27.420
so be it

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:41.600
- Owner
- Yes?

00:22:41.680 --> 00:22:43.770
I made kuksu, eat it

00:22:44.520 --> 00:22:46.060
- And...
- Moo Deok

00:22:46.140 --> 00:22:48.230
I think the barrier is around Jeonjingak

00:22:48.310 --> 00:22:50.190
this is an ice stone

00:22:50.770 --> 00:22:51.610
What?

00:22:52.230 --> 00:22:54.690
He shouldn't have understood that

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:58.490
They say stone is water, fire and wind

00:22:59.030 --> 00:23:01.030
I think the force of the wind is enveloping us

00:23:01.910 --> 00:23:04.370
If we're inside a stone

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:08.250
Can it be taken away without anyone understanding?

00:23:10.960 --> 00:23:12.170
I don't know

00:23:12.250 --> 00:23:13.880
I mastered Chisa

00:23:14.630 --> 00:23:16.470
Maybe I can catch him like a Goldfish?

00:23:16.550 --> 00:23:19.010
Your current strength doesn't even compare

00:23:19.590 --> 00:23:20.800
with ice stone

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:26.390
I hope you can regain your strength like you did on the lake

00:23:29.190 --> 00:23:30.560
I think you can do it

00:23:33.730 --> 00:23:35.440
If I take back the power

00:23:36.110 --> 00:23:38.280
and run away with the stone?

00:23:40.240 --> 00:23:42.990
If caught, you could be killed

00:23:44.200 --> 00:23:45.410
Aren't you afraid?

00:23:45.490 --> 00:23:48.210
Chances that you will run away with a stone

00:23:48.290 --> 00:23:50.210
has always existed

00:23:51.170 --> 00:23:55.050
And I already said that I will take full responsibility

00:24:00.090 --> 00:24:01.180
But

00:24:02.010 --> 00:24:03.550
I'm a little scared

00:24:04.930 --> 00:24:09.390
I'm afraid that you will break our promise and leave me without even saying goodbye

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:12.440
teacher,

00:24:12.520 --> 00:24:16.230
don't leave me, otherwise I'll cry like hell

00:24:18.990 --> 00:24:22.660
You say such embarrassing things so easily

00:24:23.990 --> 00:24:25.990
Then you will regret it

00:24:28.330 --> 00:24:31.250
It’s not difficult to say something like this, I can bear the embarrassment

00:24:31.330 --> 00:24:34.920
But I won’t turn back time, even if I regret something

00:24:36.590 --> 00:24:39.300
Teacher, put aside your embarrassment

00:24:39.380 --> 00:24:40.880
and be honest with yourself

00:24:40.970 --> 00:24:43.890
Then you won't regret anything

00:24:49.730 --> 00:24:52.020
- Chan Wook, I...
- Mister

00:24:55.650 --> 00:24:56.730
I'll be right there

00:24:57.480 --> 00:24:59.570
She has the key to the hall with forbidden books

00:24:59.650 --> 00:25:02.320
Since we're here, I want to look for something

00:25:03.360 --> 00:25:04.450
By the way

00:25:10.290 --> 00:25:11.870
Eat it yourself. Don't share with anyone

00:25:37.690 --> 00:25:41.280
Looking for books about dark magic?

00:25:41.360 --> 00:25:43.490
Yes, I heard my father left here

00:25:43.570 --> 00:25:47.030
all the books about dark magic that I received from the shaman

00:25:48.830 --> 00:25:50.330
I want to find them

00:25:53.410 --> 00:25:55.420
So these are the books of Gwangju Chang Gang

00:25:56.500 --> 00:25:57.960
I'll help

00:25:58.040 --> 00:26:01.510
I can handle it myself. You can leave me the key and go

00:26:02.920 --> 00:26:05.380
Grandfather entrusted it to me

00:26:05.470 --> 00:26:07.430
How can I be sure that you won't lose it?

00:26:07.510 --> 00:26:11.520
Well, yes. There is no faith in me. Thanks for your help

00:26:29.330 --> 00:26:31.410
Okay, attention

00:26:32.120 --> 00:26:36.750
There are enough available rooms and food in Jeongjingak

00:26:36.830 --> 00:26:40.250
So don't worry too much

00:26:40.340 --> 00:26:41.420
Let's keep calm

00:26:41.500 --> 00:26:42.630
Okay?

00:26:51.640 --> 00:26:54.600
Go to Kisan and send everyone here

00:26:54.680 --> 00:26:57.440
We also have rights to the power of the ice stone

00:26:57.520 --> 00:26:58.600
Yes

00:27:01.730 --> 00:27:03.940
Gather everyone who can cast spells

00:27:04.030 --> 00:27:05.900
Even children and old people

00:27:05.990 --> 00:27:07.240
- Yes, sir
- Okay

00:27:15.160 --> 00:27:18.290
Gather all the magicians of Jeonbugwan and send them to Sosnovy Bor

00:27:18.370 --> 00:27:20.920
A fight may break out over the ice stone

00:27:21.420 --> 00:27:22.920
We must be ready

00:27:23.000 --> 00:27:24.210
Okay

00:27:31.970 --> 00:27:32.850
Your Majesty

00:27:32.930 --> 00:27:34.770
You look sick

00:27:34.850 --> 00:27:36.850
You should go back to the palace

00:27:37.690 --> 00:27:40.730
I have to see it with my own eyes

00:27:41.770 --> 00:27:43.270
We saw an ice stone

00:27:44.360 --> 00:27:46.280
this means the King’s star is just around the corner

00:28:01.500 --> 00:28:04.960
Probably everyone is waiting for us to bring “Words of the Heart”

00:28:06.510 --> 00:28:07.840
Let's hurry

00:28:16.390 --> 00:28:17.430
Mister

00:28:17.520 --> 00:28:18.890
We brought "Words of the Heart"

00:28:18.980 --> 00:28:20.810
There's no time for them now

00:28:20.900 --> 00:28:22.690
A barrier has appeared around Jeonjingak

00:28:23.270 --> 00:28:24.400
What?

00:28:32.320 --> 00:28:34.120
Will I get caught?

00:28:36.290 --> 00:28:38.330
Then they will definitely kill you

00:29:00.020 --> 00:29:01.350
These are honey cookies

00:29:02.190 --> 00:29:05.060
You ate almost nothing. Help yourself

00:29:09.610 --> 00:29:11.280
Thank you

00:29:13.160 --> 00:29:16.240
Were you very surprised when you learned that I am the daughter of the Jin family?

00:29:16.780 --> 00:29:19.750
When we first met, I didn’t know my parents yet.

00:29:21.120 --> 00:29:22.540
This is your umbrella

00:29:24.170 --> 00:29:26.420
I carried it with me everywhere

00:29:26.500 --> 00:29:28.710
I hoped you would recognize me if we met again

00:29:32.010 --> 00:29:35.140
Gwangju Deputy Jin Moo helped you find your parents?

00:29:35.220 --> 00:29:36.220
Yes

00:29:38.180 --> 00:29:42.430
Please don't tell him we've met before

00:29:44.600 --> 00:29:46.690
If mother finds out,

00:29:46.770 --> 00:29:49.400
what I went through will break her heart

00:29:51.150 --> 00:29:53.110
So don't tell him

00:29:54.530 --> 00:29:56.660
Everyone who knew her was killed

00:29:57.240 --> 00:29:58.660
Did she spare me?

00:30:01.370 --> 00:30:04.500
Jin Moo has no idea that we know who she is

00:30:05.040 --> 00:30:06.290
This is his weakness

00:30:06.790 --> 00:30:10.420
He must have killed everyone to hide her identity.

00:30:10.500 --> 00:30:13.260
In the end she will die too

00:30:13.880 --> 00:30:16.640
If the queen plans to transfer the soul into her body...

00:30:17.220 --> 00:30:18.550
She was brought here to be killed.

00:30:18.640 --> 00:30:21.310
She doesn't know anything and does everything she can

00:30:21.390 --> 00:30:23.060
Jin Moo uses her

00:30:24.270 --> 00:30:26.230
Just like Nak Soo

00:30:29.940 --> 00:30:32.150
So Yi is also just a poor girl

00:30:34.610 --> 00:30:35.780
Mister

00:30:36.360 --> 00:30:37.610
Did you know

00:30:37.700 --> 00:30:40.030
that this umbrella doesn't do its job?

00:30:42.080 --> 00:30:45.290
Look. It's already torn

00:30:46.960 --> 00:30:48.040
And it's true

00:30:48.130 --> 00:30:50.380
It's expensive, the seller said it's high quality

00:30:50.460 --> 00:30:52.250
You must have been deceived

00:30:58.470 --> 00:31:00.010
I'm very gullible

00:31:00.930 --> 00:31:02.180
Really?

00:31:42.550 --> 00:31:44.680
Has Master Kahn gone missing?

00:31:45.350 --> 00:31:48.230
He absorbed her energy and left

00:31:48.730 --> 00:31:51.230
We can't find him Saejukwon

00:31:51.310 --> 00:31:54.360
The unified council took place next to the study halls

00:31:54.440 --> 00:31:55.650
It's unlikely he went there

00:31:55.730 --> 00:31:57.650
There was confusion all day,

00:31:57.740 --> 00:31:59.450
but we would have noticed it

00:31:59.530 --> 00:32:02.780
There's a place where he could hide

00:32:03.450 --> 00:32:04.830
and go unnoticed

00:32:07.540 --> 00:32:09.370
Inside the barrier

00:32:10.460 --> 00:32:12.420
He might be there

00:32:50.330 --> 00:32:51.620
Nomad

00:32:54.590 --> 00:32:56.000
I'm with Jin Moo

00:33:00.840 --> 00:33:02.090
I know you

00:33:02.760 --> 00:33:04.720
I saw you move your soul in Jeonbugwan

00:33:04.800 --> 00:33:07.100
Your soul has left your old body

00:33:17.820 --> 00:33:20.990
We're on the same side. Spare me

00:33:23.410 --> 00:33:25.410
Now I need human energy

00:33:25.490 --> 00:33:27.120
I'll bring someone for you

00:33:27.200 --> 00:33:28.990
The energy of the magicians of Jeongjingak

00:33:29.080 --> 00:33:31.580
it will be better than mine

00:33:32.210 --> 00:33:33.750
Wait here

00:33:33.830 --> 00:33:35.790
I'll lure someone here

00:33:37.500 --> 00:33:39.590
- Mages of Chongjingak?
- Yes

00:33:39.670 --> 00:33:41.340
Because of the barrier no one can

00:33:41.420 --> 00:33:43.720
neither leave nor enter Jeonjingak

00:33:44.340 --> 00:33:46.090
Barrier?

00:34:01.650 --> 00:34:03.030
Mrs. Jin?

00:34:03.610 --> 00:34:05.280
What are you doing here?

00:34:05.360 --> 00:34:07.280
I was looking for something

00:34:07.370 --> 00:34:09.910
but then I dropped my umbrella, I can’t walk without it

00:34:11.660 --> 00:34:12.910
Here he is

00:34:49.240 --> 00:34:50.530
I won't kill you

00:34:50.620 --> 00:34:53.120
Bring more magicians

00:34:53.700 --> 00:34:54.790
Okay

00:34:58.500 --> 00:34:59.960
Seo Yul...

00:35:00.670 --> 00:35:02.210
also in Jeongjingak?

00:35:04.880 --> 00:35:05.800
And what?

00:35:09.300 --> 00:35:10.930
He wounded me with a sword

00:35:11.510 --> 00:35:13.100
I'll kill him first

00:35:14.430 --> 00:35:15.600
It's here

00:35:16.480 --> 00:35:17.640
no

00:35:21.110 --> 00:35:22.480
If you refuse,

00:35:24.190 --> 00:35:25.530
I will kill you

00:35:25.610 --> 00:35:26.610
I'll do anything

00:35:28.200 --> 00:35:30.740
There is a person I want to get rid of

00:35:32.160 --> 00:35:33.830
I'll bring her

00:35:35.330 --> 00:35:37.000
Please kill her

00:35:50.890 --> 00:35:53.180
Snacks are not tasty

00:35:53.260 --> 00:35:54.470
Kuksu too

00:35:56.020 --> 00:35:57.770
I haven't talked to Chan Wook yet

00:35:58.350 --> 00:36:00.100
so I'll stay Moo Deok a little longer

00:36:01.150 --> 00:36:02.690
I'm sorry

00:36:03.940 --> 00:36:05.860
This is the chapter wine that Dan Gu hid

00:36:13.620 --> 00:36:14.950
How do you like the taste?

00:36:16.240 --> 00:36:17.790
Not bad

00:36:18.370 --> 00:36:20.040
I wonder what they're doing outside

00:36:20.120 --> 00:36:22.670
- since this problem has not yet been solved
- Still,

00:36:22.750 --> 00:36:26.210
there are flowers around, the weather is beautiful,

00:36:26.300 --> 00:36:28.970
everything smells fragrant. It's not that bad

00:36:30.130 --> 00:36:31.050
Your Majesty

00:36:31.130 --> 00:36:32.890
Admiring flowers is boring

00:36:32.970 --> 00:36:34.930
Want to see the Hyongong technique?

00:36:35.560 --> 00:36:38.140
This is quite an interesting technique

00:36:38.230 --> 00:36:39.270
Really?

00:36:40.060 --> 00:36:41.190
Okay, show me

00:36:41.770 --> 00:36:42.940
Yes

00:37:28.860 --> 00:37:29.900
What?..

00:37:29.990 --> 00:37:31.780
- Bom!
- Bom!

00:37:32.900 --> 00:37:34.410
Bom, wake up

00:37:34.490 --> 00:37:35.700
- Come on!
- Hey

00:37:35.780 --> 00:37:37.910
- Let's pick him up
- Bom

00:37:40.450 --> 00:37:42.540
After the spell, did the energy leave you?

00:37:42.620 --> 00:37:43.460
Yes

00:37:43.540 --> 00:37:45.750
I felt the energy leaving me

00:37:45.830 --> 00:37:46.920
As if

00:37:48.130 --> 00:37:50.300
energy poured out like from a broken vase

00:37:51.170 --> 00:37:52.720
I checked his energy core,

00:37:52.800 --> 00:37:54.550
he lost most of it

00:37:56.340 --> 00:37:57.850
How could I lose energy?

00:38:08.400 --> 00:38:09.860
Maybe it's the sword?

00:38:27.750 --> 00:38:30.170
My energy just came out through the sword

00:38:30.750 --> 00:38:32.760
I think the problem is the barrier

00:38:34.800 --> 00:38:36.760
It seems to take energy

00:38:38.970 --> 00:38:40.510
when you use spells

00:38:54.530 --> 00:38:56.320
Can't use spells

00:38:56.400 --> 00:38:58.030
and draw your swords

00:38:58.820 --> 00:39:00.410
Let's leave the swords here

00:39:09.130 --> 00:39:11.630
This is Nak Su's sword. Teacher Li took it from me

00:39:12.170 --> 00:39:13.300
Did you have it?

00:39:13.380 --> 00:39:15.970
Yes. He asked me to keep it

00:39:16.050 --> 00:39:17.840
But the maid Kim didn't like him being at home

00:39:17.930 --> 00:39:19.340
So I left it here

00:39:34.030 --> 00:39:35.860
Take this

00:39:35.940 --> 00:39:37.610
and give it to him when he returns

00:39:39.570 --> 00:39:42.160
I can’t leave when I’ve been entrusted with this

00:39:43.290 --> 00:39:44.490
Maid Kim

00:39:45.620 --> 00:39:46.870
What's there?

00:39:46.960 --> 00:39:49.420
Did the unified council go well?

00:39:49.500 --> 00:39:50.830
Hardly

00:39:50.920 --> 00:39:54.170
Mages from all families are now heading to Sosnovy Bor

00:39:55.090 --> 00:39:57.050
Something must have happened

00:39:58.630 --> 00:40:01.930
He'll have to come back because of all this fuss

00:40:09.230 --> 00:40:11.980
Will Gwangju Chang Gang really come back?

00:40:36.090 --> 00:40:38.130
Who are you?

00:40:41.220 --> 00:40:42.430
Gwangju

00:40:47.430 --> 00:40:51.650
Who is Deputy Jin Mu's assistant now?

00:41:16.540 --> 00:41:19.760
Cho Chan threatened to reveal the truth about Young Master Chan

00:41:19.840 --> 00:41:23.090
I had no choice but to teach him the alchemy of souls

00:41:23.640 --> 00:41:27.100
He went wild and died, so that means it's all over?

00:41:27.930 --> 00:41:31.270
I did this just for you and your son

00:41:32.100 --> 00:41:35.940
I lost my wife and a close friend to witchcraft.

00:41:37.190 --> 00:41:39.280
I'll get rid of all the remaining reflectors

00:41:39.900 --> 00:41:42.150
I will seal the ice stone in Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake

00:41:42.780 --> 00:41:43.910
No need...

00:41:44.860 --> 00:41:47.490
You went through so much to get it...

00:41:47.580 --> 00:41:49.450
How can you get rid of a stone?

00:41:49.540 --> 00:41:50.660
You can't do that!

00:41:52.210 --> 00:41:54.290
You also know alchemy,

00:41:55.130 --> 00:41:57.960
so I will destroy the core of your energy

00:41:58.040 --> 00:41:59.460
Destroy the core?

00:42:00.710 --> 00:42:02.170
No need

00:42:09.220 --> 00:42:12.020
Please don't destroy it

00:42:12.100 --> 00:42:15.270
I vow never to use soul alchemy

00:42:15.770 --> 00:42:19.110
which you taught me. I promise!

00:42:37.580 --> 00:42:40.840
It was worth destroying its core then

00:42:43.130 --> 00:42:46.340
Instead of hiding the ice stone,

00:42:46.930 --> 00:42:48.850
I should have destroyed him too

00:42:51.180 --> 00:42:53.890
How did he manage to get it?

00:42:55.270 --> 00:42:57.230
from Gyeongjeongdaeho Lake?

00:42:58.310 --> 00:42:59.900
Did someone help him?

00:43:31.680 --> 00:43:33.430
I'm fine

00:43:35.140 --> 00:43:37.560
But there is one difference between us

00:43:38.940 --> 00:43:40.190
I

00:43:42.440 --> 00:43:43.940
nomad

00:43:47.320 --> 00:43:48.660
Hey Bom

00:43:49.530 --> 00:43:50.910
Workouts will get you back in shape

00:43:51.490 --> 00:43:54.160
He's right, everything will be fine

00:43:54.240 --> 00:43:55.450
Cheer up

00:43:55.540 --> 00:43:58.620
The ice stone absorbs their energy

00:43:58.710 --> 00:44:01.670
If I change body and take away the stone,

00:44:02.250 --> 00:44:04.920
Will I take their energy too?

00:44:05.630 --> 00:44:08.010
You'll gain some, you'll lose some

00:44:08.090 --> 00:44:10.840
It's a burden you have to bear.

00:44:11.890 --> 00:44:13.720
If I want my power back

00:44:15.850 --> 00:44:18.140
I'll have to absorb their energy

00:44:19.440 --> 00:44:20.350
Then

00:44:21.020 --> 00:44:22.480
they will all die

00:44:33.580 --> 00:44:35.200
I will be responsible

00:44:36.160 --> 00:44:38.040
in their deaths

00:44:41.790 --> 00:44:44.540
Won Moo Deok, what are you doing here?

00:44:50.800 --> 00:44:52.340
He will die too

00:44:53.140 --> 00:44:54.470
It's dangerous here

00:44:54.550 --> 00:44:56.600
If you touch the barrier,

00:44:56.680 --> 00:44:58.640
you'll break all your bones

00:44:58.730 --> 00:45:00.230
Move away

00:45:04.400 --> 00:45:06.110
Would you like to thank me?

00:45:07.940 --> 00:45:10.240
I showed concern for you

00:45:13.280 --> 00:45:15.330
Previously you lost energy

00:45:16.240 --> 00:45:17.540
How are you feeling?

00:45:19.700 --> 00:45:22.170
Are you showing gratitude by worrying about me?

00:45:23.250 --> 00:45:24.380
Not bad

00:45:25.500 --> 00:45:27.250
I'm fine

00:45:28.420 --> 00:45:29.590
Forgive me

00:45:29.670 --> 00:45:30.920
For what?

00:45:31.010 --> 00:45:34.510
For preparing terrible snacks and kuksa

00:45:35.050 --> 00:45:36.720
You couldn't even eat

00:45:42.350 --> 00:45:43.940
Take this

00:45:48.360 --> 00:45:49.980
Chan Wook's Favorite Cookies

00:45:50.490 --> 00:45:52.860
Are you sharing with me what he gave you?

00:45:52.950 --> 00:45:55.450
No need, leave it for yourself

00:45:57.370 --> 00:46:00.370
I know I have to take them

00:46:01.870 --> 00:46:05.670
But I decided to give them to you. All

00:46:08.630 --> 00:46:10.250
I gave them to you

00:46:11.800 --> 00:46:14.880
He's not the nicest person, but he took care of me all this time.

00:46:18.470 --> 00:46:19.350
Take

00:46:19.430 --> 00:46:21.560
I want to sincerely thank you

00:46:22.930 --> 00:46:24.890
- Sincerely?
- Yes

00:46:25.560 --> 00:46:26.940
From the bottom of my heart

00:46:28.400 --> 00:46:30.230
I am always grateful to you

00:46:34.650 --> 00:46:37.280
If you want to thank me sincerely,

00:46:38.120 --> 00:46:41.330
give me something more

00:46:42.790 --> 00:46:44.330
Something more significant

00:46:51.630 --> 00:46:52.920
Just accept it

00:46:54.420 --> 00:46:56.340
This is what you need

00:47:00.220 --> 00:47:02.140
You are incredible

00:47:04.180 --> 00:47:07.150
You always dare and get your way

00:47:07.730 --> 00:47:10.520
But every time I reach out to you, you retreat

00:47:13.650 --> 00:47:16.450
The reason I'm not trying to hold you back is

00:47:17.110 --> 00:47:19.490
that if in the end you still refuse me, I...

00:47:24.790 --> 00:47:27.540
Forget it, I won't accept your gratitude in such quantities

00:47:41.010 --> 00:47:43.770
I'd feel less terrible if he accepted it

00:47:47.770 --> 00:47:48.900
That's even better

00:47:49.690 --> 00:47:52.150
I shouldn't feel guilty

00:48:16.460 --> 00:48:17.300
Moo Deok

00:48:20.180 --> 00:48:21.640
I have a favor to ask you

00:48:22.350 --> 00:48:24.600
Can you go to the mages wing for me?

00:48:25.890 --> 00:48:27.060
For what?

00:48:27.140 --> 00:48:30.140
It's cold here. Can you bring me a blanket?

00:48:31.060 --> 00:48:32.650
I heard they are kept there

00:48:46.830 --> 00:48:48.040
Okay

00:49:08.180 --> 00:49:09.850
What are you doing?

00:49:09.930 --> 00:49:12.060
Trying to keep the fire going in the brazier

00:49:31.000 --> 00:49:32.000
That's it

00:49:32.920 --> 00:49:34.210
Are you serious?

00:49:34.790 --> 00:49:36.040
Are you completely stupid?

00:49:38.710 --> 00:49:39.920
Stop

00:49:43.010 --> 00:49:45.800
Are you just calling me a fool?

00:49:45.890 --> 00:49:47.560
There are hundreds of books here

00:49:47.640 --> 00:49:49.220
You could burn them all

00:49:49.310 --> 00:49:51.270
I controlled the fire with a spell

00:49:51.350 --> 00:49:52.770
I can't use force

00:49:54.020 --> 00:49:55.310
so I'm confused

00:49:55.400 --> 00:49:58.770
But you could just cover it with a lid

00:49:58.860 --> 00:50:00.570
People call you a genius

00:50:00.650 --> 00:50:02.570
But you lose control in difficult situations

00:50:02.650 --> 00:50:05.030
- You're just a fool
- Don't insult me

00:50:05.110 --> 00:50:06.660
I'll be offended

00:50:08.490 --> 00:50:10.080
So you know how to be offended

00:50:11.370 --> 00:50:13.540
You are always as calm as water

00:50:14.040 --> 00:50:16.790
Even water can boil or freeze

00:50:17.670 --> 00:50:19.170
She doesn't always stay calm

00:50:27.430 --> 00:50:29.850
The fog made it humid

00:50:29.930 --> 00:50:32.480
Have you started a fire because your leg hurts?

00:50:34.850 --> 00:50:37.400
Do you remember about this

00:50:38.860 --> 00:50:40.020
I'm fine

00:50:40.110 --> 00:50:41.280
Don't worry

00:50:45.280 --> 00:50:47.660
Do you like pine needle tea?

00:50:49.660 --> 00:50:51.160
But I couldn’t brew it for you

00:50:52.200 --> 00:50:53.700
Do you remember this too

00:50:55.540 --> 00:50:57.080
And what's the point?

00:50:57.790 --> 00:50:59.540
Just remember

00:51:00.420 --> 00:51:02.670
Brew it next time

00:51:05.720 --> 00:51:07.300
There won't be a next time

00:51:07.390 --> 00:51:11.510
If I change body, he will die too

00:51:11.600 --> 00:51:12.470
Better yet

00:51:12.560 --> 00:51:14.850
teach me

00:51:14.930 --> 00:51:17.900
Then I'll brew it myself. Like last time

00:51:18.560 --> 00:51:19.860
Do you remember?

00:51:27.110 --> 00:51:28.240
I appreciate

00:51:29.120 --> 00:51:31.120
all memories from Danhyangok

00:51:40.790 --> 00:51:43.750
Seo Yul will die

00:51:48.630 --> 00:51:51.600
I went to the magicians' wing to get a blanket

00:51:51.680 --> 00:51:53.060
I'll go

00:52:01.150 --> 00:52:04.070
I'll go, and you go to Uku

00:52:13.580 --> 00:52:15.330
He's looking for you everywhere

00:52:27.920 --> 00:52:29.630
I just need to be Nak Soo again

00:52:30.890 --> 00:52:33.180
I have already cut off contact with him in the past.

00:52:35.220 --> 00:52:36.970
I'll do the same to everyone else

00:52:50.240 --> 00:52:53.120
The barrier will not break from your gaze

00:52:59.710 --> 00:53:00.790
Did you see it?

00:53:01.620 --> 00:53:03.210
The stone passed through him

00:53:04.040 --> 00:53:05.090
You're right

00:53:06.000 --> 00:53:08.210
Perhaps only things made of water cannot pass

00:53:08.300 --> 00:53:09.800
What a strange barrier

00:53:09.880 --> 00:53:12.760
He decides what to skip

00:53:12.840 --> 00:53:14.300
What kind of barrier is this?

00:53:15.010 --> 00:53:16.680
And what do the rest of us do?

00:53:16.760 --> 00:53:20.520
There are so many great magicians there, but they still haven't been able to break him

00:53:21.940 --> 00:53:23.690
Is it because the ice stone created it?

00:53:23.770 --> 00:53:27.610
They're probably busy arguing over who gets the stone

00:53:27.690 --> 00:53:30.820
But they know that I'm locked here

00:53:32.450 --> 00:53:37.200
Perhaps you are not that important to the queen who has the ice stone

00:53:38.660 --> 00:53:40.120
How can a mother behave like this?

00:53:41.120 --> 00:53:43.040
Or does she look like my father?

00:53:45.210 --> 00:53:46.710
That's right

00:53:46.790 --> 00:53:50.460
As you know, she is not my real mother.

00:53:51.550 --> 00:53:53.470
Just like your father did to you

00:53:55.640 --> 00:53:57.140
Everybody's talking about it

00:53:57.970 --> 00:53:59.890
I won't apologize even if it hurts you

00:54:00.600 --> 00:54:02.480
Then I won't beat around the bush either

00:54:03.190 --> 00:54:06.900
If the queen and Jin Mu offer you the power of the ice stone,

00:54:06.980 --> 00:54:08.360
can you get rid of them?

00:54:11.360 --> 00:54:15.660
It will be difficult to give up such incredible power

00:54:16.620 --> 00:54:17.830
You are brave

00:54:19.330 --> 00:54:21.950
It takes courage to openly admit your greed.

00:54:26.290 --> 00:54:29.800
What about you? What would you do if you had it?

00:54:33.300 --> 00:54:35.180
I would act like Master Seo Kyung

00:54:35.260 --> 00:54:36.430
Seo Kyung?

00:54:38.010 --> 00:54:40.760
Do you want to become a hero with the destiny of a royal star,

00:54:40.850 --> 00:54:42.770
destroy all the stones and save the world?

00:54:42.850 --> 00:54:46.440
I'm sure he did it with the best intentions

00:54:47.520 --> 00:54:50.860
And I believe he left one stone to save the one he loved

00:54:51.480 --> 00:54:53.110
also with the best intentions

00:54:53.610 --> 00:54:56.070
You see, this part resonates with me the most.

00:54:59.410 --> 00:55:01.910
So this is what he wrote in his book

00:55:01.990 --> 00:55:05.290
This is just an excuse for not being able to get rid of the stone

00:55:06.080 --> 00:55:07.370
Who will believe this?

00:55:07.460 --> 00:55:08.830
I believe

00:55:10.790 --> 00:55:13.460
'Cause I would do the same

00:55:31.020 --> 00:55:32.190
What?

00:55:32.270 --> 00:55:34.070
Stones pass through the barrier

00:55:34.150 --> 00:55:36.610
Send them a message so they can save you quickly

00:55:39.820 --> 00:55:40.660
Chan Wook

00:55:42.120 --> 00:55:43.240
You are a genius

00:55:47.250 --> 00:55:48.330
Let's see

00:55:51.670 --> 00:55:53.840
- Barrier
- Hey, Chan Wook

00:55:54.590 --> 00:55:56.420
Is there a bigger stone?

00:55:56.510 --> 00:55:58.300
They just need to read your message.

00:55:58.380 --> 00:56:00.090
You don't need a big rock

00:56:00.180 --> 00:56:01.680
Must be written in capital letters

00:56:02.390 --> 00:56:04.560
Can't lift this stone?

00:56:07.430 --> 00:56:08.690
- Let's have a drink
- Let's have a drink

00:56:09.690 --> 00:56:12.270
By the way, why didn't Dan Gu ever tell us

00:56:12.360 --> 00:56:14.860
about your secret alcohol reserves?

00:56:14.940 --> 00:56:17.280
We have to drink everything here, drink up

00:56:17.360 --> 00:56:19.780
- Let's have a drink
- Let's have a drink

00:56:24.490 --> 00:56:25.870
I brought another fryer

00:56:28.250 --> 00:56:29.460
Moo Deok

00:56:30.040 --> 00:56:31.830
Why are you here?

00:56:31.920 --> 00:56:33.000
In what sense?

00:56:35.000 --> 00:56:37.590
Mr. Yul went to get the blanket himself

00:56:40.840 --> 00:56:42.640
So Yul is also in Jeongjingak

00:56:42.720 --> 00:56:44.600
I'll kill him first

00:57:15.090 --> 00:57:17.590
Mister Yul, you are not allowed to go in there.

00:57:18.840 --> 00:57:21.180
- What happened?
- Go back

00:57:22.890 --> 00:57:25.300
Can you see me?

00:57:25.890 --> 00:57:27.430
Well...

00:58:00.180 --> 00:58:01.720
Mister!

00:58:32.170 --> 00:58:33.380
Mister

00:58:35.340 --> 00:58:38.550
Sir, what should I do?

00:58:56.990 --> 00:58:58.150
What to do?

00:59:22.220 --> 00:59:23.470
What is this?

00:59:23.550 --> 00:59:25.640
Who are you?

00:59:54.290 --> 00:59:55.710
Yul!

00:59:55.790 --> 00:59:56.630
Yul!

01:00:03.090 --> 01:00:05.470
- Mister
-Are you okay?

01:00:37.250 --> 01:00:38.380
Yul

01:00:40.050 --> 01:00:41.840
- What happened?
- Nomad

01:00:41.920 --> 01:00:43.090
Here's a nomad

01:00:43.180 --> 01:00:44.430
What?

01:00:47.930 --> 01:00:49.260
There's a nomad here

01:00:49.350 --> 01:00:51.980
He absorbed the energy of Yoon Soo and Jin Ho

01:01:07.620 --> 01:01:10.790
The nomad is the master Kang of Degantongun, he is very strong

01:01:10.870 --> 01:01:14.210
And he used the energy to cast a spell

01:01:14.290 --> 01:01:16.540
None of us can use force here

01:01:17.210 --> 01:01:18.630
Why does he succeed?

01:01:18.710 --> 01:01:21.090
This place absorbs our energy

01:01:21.170 --> 01:01:22.630
but for them it’s the other way around, apparently

01:01:25.590 --> 01:01:27.430
If I take back the power

01:01:28.050 --> 01:01:30.220
and run away with the stone?

01:01:30.890 --> 01:01:33.640
If caught, you could be killed

01:01:35.100 --> 01:01:36.310
Aren't you afraid?

01:01:36.400 --> 01:01:38.480
I'm a little scared

01:01:38.560 --> 01:01:41.070
I'm afraid that you will break our promise

01:01:41.150 --> 01:01:42.990
and leave me without even saying goodbye

01:01:45.400 --> 01:01:47.700
- Chan Wook, I...
- Mister

01:01:52.160 --> 01:01:55.120
Where is Moo Deok?

01:01:55.710 --> 01:01:57.500
She was here not long ago

01:01:58.130 --> 01:01:59.380
Where did she go?

01:02:06.090 --> 01:02:07.970
There's trouble

01:02:18.440 --> 01:02:20.770
If he is not stopped they will all die

01:02:22.820 --> 01:02:25.690
They'll still die if I change bodies

01:02:25.780 --> 01:02:27.700
It's funny to save them now

01:02:28.820 --> 01:02:30.700
So I'll cut off contact with them

01:02:35.500 --> 01:02:37.750
But I'm still uneasy

01:02:38.330 --> 01:02:41.080
This will be the last time I save them

01:02:42.000 --> 01:02:43.170
One more time

01:02:45.630 --> 01:02:46.720
You...

01:02:48.010 --> 01:02:50.720
-Where have you been?
- I came

01:02:51.220 --> 01:02:52.300
Uk...

01:02:52.930 --> 01:02:54.140
Chan Wook might die!

01:03:15.580 --> 01:03:17.370
No one can defeat him now

01:03:18.080 --> 01:03:19.710
We can't all die

01:03:19.790 --> 01:03:22.250
I'll try to lure him into the secret room

01:03:25.920 --> 01:03:28.920
When he locks the nomad with him in a secret room,

01:03:29.010 --> 01:03:30.340
Uk will die too

01:03:30.880 --> 01:03:31.970
Why?

01:03:32.720 --> 01:03:34.300
Why did he go alone?

01:03:35.220 --> 01:03:37.600
He said he had to

01:03:37.680 --> 01:03:39.100
Said it was his responsibility

01:03:46.480 --> 01:03:49.070
-Where are you going?
- To the secret room

01:03:50.450 --> 01:03:52.450
If the door in the secret room is open,

01:03:53.870 --> 01:03:56.410
this means that Uk died and could not lure him there

01:03:56.490 --> 01:03:57.990
If the door is closed,

01:03:58.910 --> 01:04:00.540
then he's probably already dead

01:04:01.290 --> 01:04:02.500
It doesn't make sense

01:04:04.790 --> 01:04:07.670
You said you wouldn't try to hold me down

01:04:08.630 --> 01:04:10.380
You can't stop me

01:04:11.380 --> 01:04:12.760
Please let me go

01:05:11.400 --> 01:05:14.990
If the door is closed, then he is probably already dead.

01:05:19.330 --> 01:05:22.870
But I won’t turn back time, even if I regret something

01:05:24.330 --> 01:05:25.540
Chan Wook

01:08:19.420 --> 01:08:20.840
You're alive

01:08:23.010 --> 01:08:24.430
my student

01:08:43.610 --> 01:08:45.240
Why did you hide this from me?

01:08:49.490 --> 01:08:50.620
Because

01:08:52.620 --> 01:08:53.870
wanted you to die

01:08:55.670 --> 01:08:56.840
Then

01:08:58.090 --> 01:08:59.380
why did you come?

01:09:02.720 --> 01:09:03.840
Because

01:09:08.050 --> 01:09:09.560
you could have died

01:09:16.230 --> 01:09:17.980
Since you took the sword in your hands,

01:09:19.360 --> 01:09:20.690
make your choice

01:09:23.650 --> 01:09:25.410
I know you've been avoiding me

01:09:25.490 --> 01:09:28.120
I know that our lives are in your hands

01:09:32.540 --> 01:09:33.870
As promised,

01:09:34.960 --> 01:09:36.540
point your sword at me first

01:09:50.930 --> 01:09:51.970
You'll kill

01:09:52.680 --> 01:09:55.270
I'll be the one who died

01:09:56.020 --> 01:09:57.400
freeing the mercenary

01:09:59.560 --> 01:10:00.860
You will spare -

01:10:01.690 --> 01:10:03.690
I'll give you another promise

01:10:27.090 --> 01:10:28.220
Now,

01:10:32.680 --> 01:10:34.560
as you said,

01:10:36.140 --> 01:10:37.980
give me another promise

01:11:26.160 --> 01:11:46.020
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:11:46.520 --> 01:11:49.520
Alchemy

01:11:46.520 --> 01:11:49.520
Shower

01:11:51.420 --> 01:11:54.600
What kind of person could refuse such incredible power?

01:11:54.680 --> 01:11:56.970
To protect what we must...

01:11:57.060 --> 01:11:58.470
What if I give it my all?

01:11:58.560 --> 01:12:00.350
I'm trying to protect you too

01:12:01.100 --> 01:12:02.940
What is he doing here?

01:12:03.020 --> 01:12:05.520
Jin Bu Young's Incredible Divine Power

01:12:05.610 --> 01:12:07.690
she inherited not only from her mother, a member of the Jin family

01:12:07.780 --> 01:12:11.070
Park Jin! You hid the truth, knowing everything perfectly well

01:12:12.990 --> 01:12:17.490
And now those who must go will go, and those who must return will return

01:12:17.580 --> 01:12:20.160
Mister, do what you think is necessary.

01:12:20.250 --> 01:12:23.420
I'll try this not out of stupidity, but out of zeal

01:12:23.500 --> 01:12:25.000
My teacher taught me this

01:12:25.080 --> 01:12:27.420
- Looks good
- Wow

01:12:27.500 --> 01:12:29.840
I heard there's a bride here whose wedding is coming soon
